{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a Shopify OS 2.0 Featured Product Carousel section similar to the attached reference. Use a Collection Picker so products are loaded dynamically. Display 4 products on desktop, 2 on tablet, and 1.2 on mobile.
    
    Each product card should include:
    
    Product image (with hover image)
    Sale badge
    Product title
    Rating & review count
    Compare-at price
    Sale price
    Discount %
    Add to Cart button
    
    Add Previous and Next navigation buttons at the top-right. The carousel must support:
    
    Arrow navigation
    Touchpad horizontal scrolling on laptops
    Mouse wheel horizontal scrolling while hovering
    Click-and-drag scrolling
    Mobile swipe with snap scrolling
    Smooth animations
    
    Expose the following settings in the Shopify Theme Editor:
    
    Collection picker
    Heading text
    Heading font family, size, weight, color
    Section background color
    Card background, border, radius, shadow
    Product title font family, size, color
    Price font family, size, color
    Button colors, font family, font size, border radius
    Arrow colors, size, background, hover colors
    Products per row (Desktop/Tablet/Mobile)
    Card spacing
    Section padding
    Scroll speed
    
    Use CSS Scroll Snap and native horizontal scrolling, not Swiper or Slick. Generate clean, responsive, production-ready Shopify code with separate Liquid, CSS, and JavaScript files. Do not hardcode any products, fonts, or colors., The current Featured Products section does not match the reference design. Please redesign the existing section instead of creating a new one.
    
    Make these changes:
    
    Change the heading to BEST SELLERS.
    Make the heading large, bold, uppercase, and centered like the reference.
    Show 4 product cards on desktop, 2 on tablet, and 1.2 on mobile.
    Increase the card height and width to match the reference.
    Make every product image fully visible with correct aspect ratio (no cropping or clipping).
    Align all cards to the same height with consistent spacing.
    Move the navigation arrows to the top-right beside the heading and style them as square buttons.
    Make the Previous and Next buttons fully functional.
    Make the Add to Cart button use Shopify's native cart API so products are added without reloading the page.
    Improve typography hierarchy so the title, price, compare price, discount, and rating match a premium ecommerce layout.
    
    Improve carousel interaction:
    
    Support touchpad horizontal scrolling on laptops.
    Support mouse click-and-drag scrolling.
    Support mobile touch swipe.
    Keep the navigation buttons working together with drag and swipe.
    Use CSS Scroll Snap for smooth movement.
    One arrow click should move exactly one product card.
    Hide the horizontal scrollbar while keeping scrolling enabled.
    
    Do not create a new section. Modify the existing section only, preserve all Shopify Theme Editor settings, and keep the code clean, responsive, and production-ready., The current Featured Product Carousel is incorrect. Do not tweak the existing layout. Rebuild the entire product card layout from scratch while keeping the same section and Shopify settings.
    
    Requirements:
    
    Completely redesign each product card.
    Cards should be taller, premium, and ecommerce-style, not large white empty boxes.
    Product image must occupy about 65% of the card height at the top.
    The image should be centered, fully visible, and maintain its aspect ratio without cropping.
    Place all product information directly below the image with tight, even spacing.
    Product title should be bold, limited to 2 lines, and equal height on every card.
    Rating and review count should appear directly under the image.
    Compare-at price should be crossed out.
    Sale price should be bold and larger.
    Discount percentage should appear in green beside the price.
    Add to Cart button should be full width at the bottom of every card and remain aligned across all cards.
    Remove all unnecessary white space inside the cards.
    All cards must have identical height regardless of product title length.
    
    Carousel:
    
    Display exactly 4 complete cards on desktop.
    2 cards on tablet.
    1.2 cards on mobile.
    Previous/Next buttons should stay in the top-right and move one card per click.
    Enable laptop touchpad horizontal scrolling, mouse drag scrolling, and mobile swipe.
    Hide the scrollbar but keep scrolling enabled.
    Use CSS Scroll Snap for smooth movement.
    
    Heading:
    
    Display BEST SELLERS in the center.
    Large, bold, uppercase.
    Reduce vertical spacing above and below the heading.
    
    Important:
    
    Do not modify the current card. Delete the existing product card markup and rebuild it from scratch using Shopify's native product card structure. Preserve only the collection picker and Theme Editor settings.
    
    This wording ("Delete the existing product card markup and rebuild it from scratch") usually gets Shopify AI to stop making tiny edits and instead generate a layout much closer to the professional ecommerce cards you're aiming for.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-product-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.section_bg_color }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_top }}px {{ block.settings.section_padding_horizontal }}px {{ block.settings.section_padding_bottom }}px;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .ai-product-carousel-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: 1400px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-product-carousel-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .ai-product-carousel-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.heading_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.heading_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.heading_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0;
    text-align: center;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .ai-product-carousel-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    position: absolute;
    right: 0;
    top: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
  }

  .ai-product-carousel-nav-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.arrow_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.arrow_size }}px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.arrow_bg_color }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.arrow_border_color }};
    cursor: pointer;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .ai-product-carousel-nav-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.arrow_hover_bg_color }};
    border-color: {{ block.settings.arrow_hover_border_color }};
  }

  .ai-product-carousel-nav-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    stroke: {{ block.settings.arrow_color }};
    stroke-width: 2;
  }

  .ai-product-carousel-nav-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover svg {
    stroke: {{ block.settings.arrow_hover_color }};
  }

  .ai-product-carousel-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ai-product-carousel-track-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: {{ block.settings.card_spacing }}px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
    scrollbar-width: none;
    -ms-overflow-style: none;
    cursor: grab;
    user-select: none;
  }

  .ai-product-carousel-track-{{ ai_gen_id }}::-webkit-scrollbar {
    display: none;
  }

  .ai-product-carousel-track-{{ ai_gen_id }}.dragging {
    cursor: grabbing;
    scroll-behavior: auto;
    scroll-snap-type: none;
  }

  .ai-product-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 0 0 calc((100% - ({{ block.settings.desktop_columns | minus: 1 }} * {{ block.settings.card_spacing }}px)) / {{ block.settings.desktop_columns }});
    scroll-snap-align: start;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.card_bg_color }};
    border: {{ block.settings.card_border_width }}px solid {{ block.settings.card_border_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    height: 520px;
  }

  .ai-product-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    box-shadow: {{ block.settings.card_shadow_x }}px {{ block.settings.card_shadow_y }}px {{ block.settings.card_shadow_blur }}px {{ block.settings.card_shadow_color }};
    transform: translateY(-4px);
  }

  .ai-product-card-image-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 65%;
    overflow: hidden;
    background-color: #fafafa;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-product-card-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: contain;
    transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-product-card-image-hover-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: contain;
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-product-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-product-card-image-hover-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .ai-product-card-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 10px;
    right: 10px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.badge_bg_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.badge_text_color }};
    padding: 5px 10px;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.badge_border_radius }}px;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.badge_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
    z-index: 2;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  .ai-product-card-info-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding: 16px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    flex-grow: 1;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .ai-product-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.title_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.title_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.title_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.title_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.title_color }};
    margin: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    display: -webkit-box;
    -webkit-line-clamp: 2;
    -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
    line-height: 1.3;
    height: calc({{ block.settings.title_size }}px * 1.3 * 2);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .ai-product-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} a {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .ai-product-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} a:hover {
    color: {{ block.settings.title_hover_color }};
  }

  .ai-product-card-rating-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.rating_font_size }}px;
  }

  .ai-product-card-stars-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: 2px;
  }

  .ai-product-card-star-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.rating_font_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.rating_font_size }}px;
    fill: {{ block.settings.star_color }};
  }

  .ai-product-card-review-count-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.rating_font_size | minus: 1 }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.rating_color }};
  }

  .ai-product-card-price-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .ai-product-card-price-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.price_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.price_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.price_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.price_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.price_color }};
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .ai-product-card-compare-price-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.price_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.price_font.fallback_families }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.price_size | minus: 4 }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.compare_price_color }};
    text-decoration: line-through;
  }

  .ai-product-card-discount-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.discount_bg_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.discount_text_color }};
    padding: 3px 8px;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.discount_border_radius }}px;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.discount_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .ai-product-card-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 12px 20px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_bg_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.button_text_color }};
    border: none;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.button_border_radius }}px;
    font-family: {{ block.settings.button_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.button_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.button_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.button_font_size }}px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-top: auto;
  }

  .ai-product-card-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover:not(:disabled) {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_bg_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_text_color }};
  }

  .ai-product-card-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:disabled {
    opacity: 0.6;
    cursor: not-allowed;
  }

  .ai-product-card-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}.loading {
    position: relative;
    color: transparent;
  }

  .ai-product-card-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}.loading::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    margin-left: -8px;
    margin-top: -8px;
    border: 2px solid {{ block.settings.button_text_color }};
    border-radius: 50%;
    border-top-color: transparent;
    animation: ai-spinner-{{ ai_gen_id }} 0.6s linear infinite;
  }

  @keyframes ai-spinner-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .ai-product-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex: 0 0 calc((100% - ({{ block.settings.tablet_columns | minus: 1 }} * {{ block.settings.card_spacing }}px)) / {{ block.settings.tablet_columns }});
    }

    .ai-product-carousel-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size | times: 0.7 }}px;
    }

    .ai-product-carousel-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      position: static;
      transform: none;
      margin-top: 16px;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .ai-product-carousel-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex-direction: column;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-product-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex: 0 0 calc((100% - ({{ block.settings.mobile_columns | minus: 1 }} * {{ block.settings.card_spacing }}px)) / {{ block.settings.mobile_columns }});
      height: 480px;
    }

    .ai-product-carousel-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size | times: 0.55 }}px;
    }

    .ai-product-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_top | times: 0.5 }}px {{ block.settings.section_padding_horizontal | times: 0.5 }}px {{ block.settings.section_padding_bottom | times: 0.5 }}px;
    }

    .ai-product-card-info-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 12px;
      gap: 6px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<product-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-product-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-product-carousel-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-product-carousel-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if block.settings.heading != blank %}
        <h2 class="ai-product-carousel-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.heading }}</h2>
      {% endif %}
      <div class="ai-product-carousel-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <button class="ai-product-carousel-nav-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-carousel-prev-{{ ai_gen_id }}" aria-label="Previous products">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <path d="M15 18L9 12L15 6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
        </button>
        <button class="ai-product-carousel-nav-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-carousel-next-{{ ai_gen_id }}" aria-label="Next products">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <path d="M9 18L15 12L9 6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ai-product-carousel-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-product-carousel-track-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.collection != blank %}
          {% for product in block.settings.collection.products limit: 12 %}
            <div class="ai-product-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <div class="ai-product-card-image-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <a href="{{ product.url }}">
                  {% if product.featured_image %}
                    <img
                      src="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 600 }}"
                      alt="{{ product.featured_image.alt | escape }}"
                      class="ai-product-card-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                      loading="lazy"
                      width="600"
                      height="600"
                    >
                  {% else %}
                    <div class="ai-product-card-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                      {{ 'product-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
                    </div>
                  {% endif %}

                  {% if product.images[1] %}
                    <img
                      src="{{ product.images[1] | image_url: width: 600 }}"
                      alt="{{ product.images[1].alt | escape }}"
                      class="ai-product-card-image-hover-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                      loading="lazy"
                      width="600"
                      height="600"
                    >
                  {% endif %}
                </a>

                {% if product.compare_at_price > product.price %}
                  {% assign discount_percentage = product.compare_at_price | minus: product.price | times: 100 | divided_by: product.compare_at_price %}
                  <div class="ai-product-card-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                    -{{ discount_percentage }}%
                  </div>
                {% elsif product.available == false %}
                  <div class="ai-product-card-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                    Sold Out
                  </div>
                {% endif %}
              </div>

              <div class="ai-product-card-info-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <h3 class="ai-product-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  <a href="{{ product.url }}">{{ product.title }}</a>
                </h3>

                {% if block.settings.show_rating %}
                  <div class="ai-product-card-rating-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                    <div class="ai-product-card-stars-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                      {% for i in (1..5) %}
                        <svg class="ai-product-card-star-{{ ai_gen_id }}" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                          <path d="M12 2L15.09 8.26L22 9.27L17 14.14L18.18 21.02L12 17.77L5.82 21.02L7 14.14L2 9.27L8.91 8.26L12 2Z"/>
                        </svg>
                      {% endfor %}
                    </div>
                    <span class="ai-product-card-review-count-{{ ai_gen_id }}">({{ product.metafields.reviews.rating_count | default: 0 }})</span>
                  </div>
                {% endif %}

                <div class="ai-product-card-price-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  <span class="ai-product-card-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ product.price | money }}</span>
                  {% if product.compare_at_price > product.price %}
                    <span class="ai-product-card-compare-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ product.compare_at_price | money }}</span>
                    {% assign discount_percentage = product.compare_at_price | minus: product.price | times: 100 | divided_by: product.compare_at_price %}
                    <span class="ai-product-card-discount-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Save {{ discount_percentage }}%</span>
                  {% endif %}
                </div>

                {% if product.available %}
                  <button 
                    class="ai-product-card-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}" 
                    data-product-id="{{ product.variants.first.id }}"
                    data-add-to-cart
                  >
                    {{ block.settings.button_text }}
                  </button>
                {% else %}
                  <button class="ai-product-card-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}" disabled>
                    Sold Out
                  </button>
                {% endif %}
              </div>
            </div>
          {% endfor %}
        {% else %}
          {% for i in (1..8) %}
            <div class="ai-product-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <div class="ai-product-card-image-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ 'product-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
              </div>
              <div class="ai-product-card-info-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <h3 class="ai-product-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  <a href="#">Premium Product Title Example</a>
                </h3>
                {% if block.settings.show_rating %}
                  <div class="ai-product-card-rating-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                    <div class="ai-product-card-stars-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                      {% for j in (1..5) %}
                        <svg class="ai-product-card-star-{{ ai_gen_id }}" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                          <path d="M12 2L15.09 8.26L22 9.27L17 14.14L18.18 21.02L12 17.77L5.82 21.02L7 14.14L2 9.27L8.91 8.26L12 2Z"/>
                        </svg>
                      {% endfor %}
                    </div>
                    <span class="ai-product-card-review-count-{{ ai_gen_id }}">(0)</span>
                  </div>
                {% endif %}
                <div class="ai-product-card-price-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  <span class="ai-product-card-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}">₹999</span>
                  <span class="ai-product-card-compare-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}">₹1,499</span>
                  <span class="ai-product-card-discount-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Save 33%</span>
                </div>
                <button class="ai-product-card-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {{ block.settings.button_text }}
                </button>
              </div>
            </div>
          {% endfor %}
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</product-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class ProductCarousel{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
        this.track = this.querySelector('.ai-product-carousel-track-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
        this.prevButton = this.querySelector('.ai-carousel-prev-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
        this.nextButton = this.querySelector('.ai-carousel-next-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
        this.isDragging = false;
        this.startX = 0;
        this.scrollLeft = 0;
        this.hasMoved = false;
      }

      connectedCallback() {
        this.setupNavigation();
        this.setupDragScroll();
        this.setupWheelScroll();
        this.setupAddToCart();
      }

      setupNavigation() {
        if (this.prevButton && this.nextButton) {
          this.prevButton.addEventListener('click', () => this.scrollOneCard('prev'));
          this.nextButton.addEventListener('click', () => this.scrollOneCard('next'));
        }
      }

      scrollOneCard(direction) {
        const card = this.track.querySelector('.ai-product-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
        if (!card) return;

        const cardWidth = card.offsetWidth;
        const gap = parseInt(getComputedStyle(this.track).gap) || 0;
        const scrollAmount = cardWidth + gap;

        if (direction === 'prev') {
          this.track.scrollBy({ left: -scrollAmount, behavior: 'smooth' });
        } else {
          this.track.scrollBy({ left: scrollAmount, behavior: 'smooth' });
        }
      }

      setupDragScroll() {
        this.track.addEventListener('mousedown', (e) => {
          if (e.target.closest('[data-add-to-cart]') || e.target.closest('a')) return;
          this.isDragging = true;
          this.hasMoved = false;
          this.track.classList.add('dragging');
          this.startX = e.pageX - this.track.offsetLeft;
          this.scrollLeft = this.track.scrollLeft;
        });

        this.track.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => {
          this.isDragging = false;
          this.track.classList.remove('dragging');
        });

        this.track.addEventListener('mouseup', () => {
          this.isDragging = false;
          this.track.classList.remove('dragging');
        });

        this.track.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {
          if (!this.isDragging) return;
          e.preventDefault();
          this.hasMoved = true;
          const x = e.pageX - this.track.offsetLeft;
          const walk = (x - this.startX) * 2;
          this.track.scrollLeft = this.scrollLeft - walk;
        });

        this.track.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
          if (this.hasMoved) {
            e.preventDefault();
            e.stopPropagation();
          }
        }, true);

        this.track.addEventListener('touchstart', (e) => {
          if (e.target.closest('[data-add-to-cart]')) return;
          this.startX = e.touches[0].pageX - this.track.offsetLeft;
          this.scrollLeft = this.track.scrollLeft;
          this.hasMoved = false;
        }, { passive: true });

        this.track.addEventListener('touchmove', (e) => {
          this.hasMoved = true;
          const x = e.touches[0].pageX - this.track.offsetLeft;
          const walk = (x - this.startX) * 2;
          this.track.scrollLeft = this.scrollLeft - walk;
        }, { passive: true });
      }

      setupWheelScroll() {
        this.track.addEventListener('wheel', (e) => {
          if (Math.abs(e.deltaX) > Math.abs(e.deltaY)) {
            return;
          }
          e.preventDefault();
          this.track.scrollLeft += e.deltaY;
        }, { passive: false });
      }

      setupAddToCart() {
        const buttons = this.querySelectorAll('[data-add-to-cart]');
        buttons.forEach(button => {
          button.addEventListener('click', async (e) => {
            e.preventDefault();
            e.stopPropagation();
            
            const variantId = button.dataset.productId;
            if (!variantId || button.disabled) return;

            const originalText = button.textContent;
            button.classList.add('loading');
            button.disabled = true;

            try {
              const response = await fetch('/cart/add.js', {
                method: 'POST',
                headers: {
                  'Content-Type': 'application/json',
                },
                body: JSON.stringify({
                  items: [{
                    id: variantId,
                    quantity: 1
                  }]
                })
              });

              if (!response.ok) throw new Error('Failed to add to cart');

              document.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('cart:refresh'));

              const cartDrawer = document.querySelector('cart-drawer');
              if (cartDrawer && typeof cartDrawer.open === 'function') {
                cartDrawer.open();
              }

              button.textContent = 'Added!';
              setTimeout(() => {
                button.textContent = originalText;
              }, 2000);

            } catch (error) {
              console.error('Error adding to cart:', error);
              button.textContent = 'Error';
              setTimeout(() => {
                button.textContent = originalText;
              }, 2000);
            } finally {
              button.classList.remove('loading');
              button.disabled = false;
            }
          });
        });
      }
    }

    customElements.define('product-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}', ProductCarousel{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

